 # Changelog
 
+## 0.3.2.266
+
+- Admit Tahoe 26.6 and servicing releases as an experimental installer range, retaining runtime ABI and instruction checks.
+- Keep earlier macOS ranges, signed payloads and provider dependencies unchanged.
+- Exercise generated installer choices and volume checks for the expanded range.
+
 ## 0.3.2
 
 - Fix OpenGL texture updates and missing geometry for the measured six-bank VS-only and VS/GS URB layouts on Big Sur–Tahoe. Handle all four measured layouts in one rule set while preserving the four/eight-bank corrections.
